@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@ownerToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@tenantToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@organizationId = REPLACE
@propertyId = REPLACE
@leaseId = REPLACE
@inspectionId = REPLACE
@revisionId = REPLACE
@documentHash = REPLACE_FROM_REPORT
@manager = {{base}}/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}
@tenant = {{base}}/me/leases/{{leaseId}}

### Explicitly enable tracking after both parties sign (use a fresh request UUID)
POST {{manager}}/inspections/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","leaseVersion":0}

### Create the move-in draft. Replace observedAt with the actual UTC observation time.
POST {{manager}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "kind":"MOVE_IN",
  "details":{
    "title":"Move-in condition and key handover",
    "observedAt":"2026-10-16T09:00:00Z",
    "summary":"Inspected with the tenant before possession.",
    "items":[{"key":"living-room-wall","area":"Living room","name":"Painted wall","condition":"GOOD","quantity":1,"notes":"Existing small mark photographed.","estimatedCharge":null}],
    "meters":[{"key":"water","label":"Water meter","serialNumber":"EXAMPLE-001","reading":123.456,"unit":"m3"}],
    "keys":[{"key":"front-door","label":"Front door keys","expectedCount":2,"transferredCount":2}],
    "evidenceIds":[]
  }
}

### Inspect current report/version and download exact revision before attesting
GET {{manager}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Exact JSON document (audited, private attachment)
GET {{manager}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}/revisions/{{revisionId}}/document
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Share reviewed revision. Enter password locally; never commit request secrets.
POST {{manager}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}/share
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333","version":0,"revisionId":"{{revisionId}}","documentHash":"{{documentHash}}","consent":true,"vacancyConfirmed":false,"password":"ENTER_LOCALLY","reason":"The report accurately records my observations and handover."}

### Tenant reviews only shared content
GET {{tenant}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant accepts this exact revision (use current report version)
POST {{tenant}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444","version":1,"revisionId":"{{revisionId}}","documentHash":"{{documentHash}}","consent":true,"vacancyConfirmed":false,"password":"ENTER_LOCALLY","reason":"I reviewed condition, readings, actual key counts and evidence."}

### Alternative: tenant disputes before acceptance; manager must revise and reshare
POST {{tenant}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}/dispute
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555","version":1,"revisionId":"{{revisionId}}","reason":"Please record the existing wall mark.","itemKeys":["living-room-wall"]}

### Attestation receipts and history
GET {{tenant}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}/attestations?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### History
GET {{tenant}}/inspections/{{inspectionId}}/history?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Baseline comparison once a MOVE_OUT report is shared
GET {{tenant}}/inspections/comparison
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Checkout shows inspection, billing, maintenance and lease-state blockers
GET {{manager}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### For MOVE_OUT: create near the agreed end, record final readings and actual returned
### key counts, set vacancyConfirmed=true on BOTH share and tenant acceptance.
### Use existing /complete, billing/deposit reconciliation and /release-unit afterward.
### Upload photos using multipart file/requestId/version/caption to
### {lease}/inspections/{inspectionId}/evidence, then select evidenceIds in a new revision.
